The Wizard of Yendor, Medusa, and all Quest Nemeses resist even being
made peaceful by a taming attempt. Shopkeepers, vault guards, priests,
minions, covetous monsters, your Quest Leader, and all humans cannot
be tamed. (Note that polymorph means that the last category doesn't
subsume as many of the others as it might seem.) Demons can only be
tamed if you are polyselfed into a demon yourself. All d have a chance
of resisting taming during nights of the full moon.

